                <pb facs="0898" n="800" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg800"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Newel to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The
                                Hague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1900-10-18"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October 18,
                    1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>[Mr. Newel reports the simultaneous delivery by the Russian minister and himself
                    of an identical note inviting Mr. Asser to act as arbitrator.]</p>
            </div>
